</span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e47c6aa6-415a-4fd8-a12b-14014a50edf2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e47c6aa6-415a-4fd8-a12b-14014a50edf2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e47c6aa6-415a-4fd8-a12b-14014a50edf2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude\" title=\"Mask of Servitude\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Servitude\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude\" title=\"Mask of Servitude\">Mask of Servitude</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Tunnel\" title=\"Overgrown Tunnel\">Overgrown Tunnel</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Read this every morning. \n</p><p>Remember. <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">She</a> is not your friend. She is not your family. \n</p><p>Do not eat the food unless she is watching. \n</p><p>Do not drink the tea unless she is watching. \n</p><p>Do not wear the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\">mask</a>. \n</p><p>Do not wear the mask. \n</p><p>Do not wear the mask.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The word 'LIES' is written in large, thick letters across the rest of the text.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234324\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1847/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31916/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7963/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936248/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.988      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.988      1 -total\n 56.88%   23.883      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.20%   21.080     19 Template:Trim\n 22.23%    9.335      2 Template:Uid\n 15.45%    6.487      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.94%    6.274      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.55%    5.269      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.50%    4.407      1 Template:Ifexist\n 10.40%    4.368      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12643-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234324 and revision id 365529. Rendering was triggered because: unknown